1. Port ScanningQuickly check which ports are open on a target IP without sending payloads.

nc -zv 192.168.1.50 1-1000

Send and receive files between the attacker and target machine.
On the receiving machine (e.g., Target): 
nc -l -p 1234 > received_file.txtOn 
the sending machine (e.g., Attacker): nc 192.168.1.50 1234 < file_to_send.txt
